OL,3,GNEWSAE-bike battery in fatal fire was
OL,4,Arepaired - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FScott Peden told the inquest he had
OL,7,Fbought a replacement battery after the
OL,8,Fprevious one had been stolen and the
OL,9,Fbike later cut out, and had visited a
OL,10,Frepairman twice for work done.
